[00:00.0000]作曲 : tabeyellow*
[00:01.0200]DJ OKAWARI
[00:02.7800]
[00:05.0300]They serve the purpose of changing (这种植物把氢)
[00:07.0100]hydrogen into breathable oxygen (转换为可呼吸的氧，)
[00:09.2300]And they're as necessary here (就像地球上的空气)
[00:12.0100]as the air is on earth. (一样重要。)
[00:14.0000]But I still say... they're flowers. (但我还是觉得…这就是花。)
[00:17.0500]If you like. (请随意。)
[00:20.0400]Do you sell them? (这些花你卖吗？)
[00:21.9600]I am afraid Not. (恐怕不卖。)
[00:23.0000]But... Maybe we can make a deal. (但也许我们可以做个交易？)
[00:35.0000](——对话出自1960年的电影《Assignment: Outer Space》19'22'')
